  "userInputText": "In Vampire Survivors, the main goal is to survive for 30 minutes. The objective of the game is to keep the chosen character alive while more and more powerful adversaries assault. As the player advances in levels and dispatches a significant number of hostile monsters, new weapons and gear can be obtained.Guide to PlayVampire Survivors' main goal is to survive against monsters by selecting a playable character and entering a big battle field. The player starts out with just one weapon to use against opponents. Players can acquire new weapons and passive items by leveling up and gaining experience by defeating opponents. Upgrade their current ones as well to help them survive the tougher enemies that are still to come.Other Survival GamesFlyOrDie.ioRoblox DoorsAmong Us"
